==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*1 [[Cyberhorn]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*2 [[Zigge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spawn a [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], no talent needed, although preferably with the Target Alien talent. Once you have enough cash, spawn [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. Those two should easily kill the Cyberhorn, Awakened Bahamut would rush to the base, the Zigges would burrow under him, and Awakened Bahamut would at most need 3 hits to destroy the base. If you have not unlocked Awakened Bahamut Cat yet, you could spam Can Can Cats/[[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cats]] instead. Those two would be enough to destroy the base, along with the Zigges, if they accidentally hit one of them.

